        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" 8 Wire Electric Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty 4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" 8 wire electric transfer commercial  door hinge with ball bearings and Non-Removable Pin. 12\" wire lead on one leaf, 36\" wire lead on the other leaf. 28 gauge wires rated 3.5 amps. UL Listed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a  Non-Removable Pin (NRP) for security.\r\n Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo E8W-BB74545-652 Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Electrical Wires: (8) 28 gauge wires</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A8111</li>\r\n<li> Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish: Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with machine screws and wood screws. For use with  heavy metal or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
